<title>USA: Florida $200 mln bonds won by Smith Barney.</title>
<headline>Florida $200 mln bonds won by Smith Barney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Thursday it won $200 million Florida Department of Transportation bonds at a true interest cost of 5.16 percent.</p>
</text>
